shedman-browser(1)

# NAME

shedman-browser - launch the default web browser

# SYNOPSIS

*shedman browser*

# DESCRIPTION

Launches the desktop's default browser (*xdg-open*-resolved). Bound
to *Super+B*; exists as a subcommand so the bind survives browser
swaps.

# SEE ALSO

*shedman-launcher*(1)
